[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9495.63, "timestamp": "02:38:15", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9498.11, "timestamp": "02:38:18", "text": "由于游戏目前无法正常运行，出现了一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9500.87, "timestamp": "02:38:20", "text": "问题，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9503.67, "timestamp": "02:38:23", "text": "我们就到此为止吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9506.71, "timestamp": "02:38:26", "text": "至少玩玩射击场之类的设施真的很有趣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9510.47, "timestamp": "02:38:30", "text": "。 还要达成"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9514.27, "timestamp": "02:38:34", "text": "揍了克里斯托弗这个成就。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9516.19, "timestamp": "02:38:36", "text": "我应该在测试版中就这么做的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9518.87, "timestamp": "02:38:38", "text": "，但我忘了在正式版中这么做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9522.51, "timestamp": "02:38:42", "text": "。  [音乐] 我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9527.43, "timestamp": "02:38:47", "text": "今天发布的是 alpha 版本，也就是抢先体验版。 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9528.83, "timestamp": "02:38:48", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9531.07, "timestamp": "02:38:51", "text": "我今晚晚些时候会直播这场比赛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9532.63, "timestamp": "02:38:52", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9533.83, "timestamp": "02:38:53", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9536.87, "timestamp": "02:38:56", "text": "就像我晚上那样。   是的"}]